add('37424220','WB_2014_Haridevpur','officer_weapon_taking_reverse_fatality','2014-06-27','Haridevpur, Kolkata','Ashok Das; homeguard Raju Goyala killed','West Bengal police','identified individual suspect','constable service revolver','completed_claim','not_applicable_accused_survived','no','detention_during_domestic_violence_response','Suspect took revolver and killed a homeguard; locals captured him alive and police disarmed him. Reversed victim direction excludes target outcome.')
